{"3999030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shifted", "steam_appid": 3999030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------SHIFTED----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999030/extras/f347bc1226b3b5da879a3acbe14607cd.avif?t=1763712144\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999030/extras_big/f347bc1226b3b5da879a3acbe14607cd.webp?t=1763712144 width=1560 height=502 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------YOU MUST ESCAPE---------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been imprisoned in a lab. The only thing you see is a  room full of normal household stuff and two buttons: <strong>GREEN &amp; RED</strong>. You're instructed to search for anomalies and every round, you must decide if the room has shifted and if there is an anomaly. You've also been instructed to try to get as high score as possible. But there lies something deeper:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why are you imprisoned? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you escape? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is going on?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999030/extras/e51772c7b89bba90d541665ac09e7ce7.avif?t=1763712144\" width=200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>You don't know where you are imprisoned.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb